## CatalogProductGroupsApi

### List products by product group
## List products by product group
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/product_groups/{{product_group_id}}/products?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&pinMetrics={{pinMetrics}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Create product group
## Create product group
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/product_groups?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Create product groups
## Create product groups
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/product_groups/multiple?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Delete product group
## Delete product group
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/product_groups/{{product_group_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Delete product groups
## Delete product groups
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/product_groups/multiple?id={{id}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get product group
## Get product group
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/product_groups/{{product_group_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### List product groups
## List product groups
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/product_groups?id={{id}}&feedId={{feedId}}&catalogId={{catalogId}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Get product counts
## Get product counts
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/product_groups/{{product_group_id}}/product_counts?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Update single product group
## Update single product group
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/product_groups/{{product_group_id}}?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### List products by filter
## List products by filter
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/products/get_by_product_group_filters?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&pinMetrics={{pinMetrics}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

